WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.014
Fuyutsuki.

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:05.755
Wake up Rei.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.090
Is she viable?

00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:08.925
She isn't dead.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.052
Understood.

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:14.347
-Rei?
-Yes?

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.475
The backup isn't working out.
I need you again.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.601
Yes, sir.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.107
Rewrite Unit 01's core system
for Rei! Reactivate!

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.610
Roger. Suspending current tasks
and initiating reactivation.

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:33.366
I knew it... No one wants me.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.276
Look out!

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:20.538
-The Eva moved!
-What the hell?

00:01:20.705 --> 00:01:22.832
Its right arm broke free
of its restraints!

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:27.003
What?! That can't be!
It doesn't have an entry plug inserted!

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.338
It's incapable of moving!

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:32.008
It reacted without any
interface connection?

00:01:32.675 --> 00:01:35.595
Or was it trying... to protect him?

00:01:36.846 --> 00:01:37.847
This will work.

00:01:59.077 --> 00:02:00.328
Don't run away.

00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:08.878
I'll do it. I'll be the pilot!

00:02:12.507 --> 00:02:15.468
-Cooling cycle complete!
-Right arm reattachment complete.

